{"id":1111203,"name":"露米娜·审查Ⅲ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"露米娜·审查Ⅲ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1111203]}],"trial":{"trial_id":111203,"stage":"阶段3","unlock_time":"2026-01-15 14:00:00","diary1":"你从诡异的白光中醒来，竟发现自己来到了露米娜口中曾经和哥哥相依为命的“安全小屋”——破漏的窗户、锅炉上的热气都是那么真实，而眼前灰色的小女孩将她珍藏的所有绘本拿了出来，冲你露出甜美的笑容……她究竟想要做什么？","diary2":"曾经唯一依赖的亲人惨痛离世，她的潜意识无法接受那样的痛苦，因此执拗地寻找一个又一个新的“安全小屋”。这个安全屋可以是房屋，也可以是一个人，一个哥哥一样无私的庇护者——而你选择拥抱她的苦痛，用绘本的方式巧妙地化解着她的执念，给予她来自一个真正“庇护者”的引导……她也真正回想起了哥哥的脸，逐渐接受眼前的一切，并尝试着迈开新的步伐。\n　　你看向手中不断变换字迹的小纸条，这一次，那个“魔女”在这个过程里……又扮演了什么样的角色呢？","evidence":[{"ID":260849,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260850,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211203022,"next":